    "dominant_measured_stages": "Atmosphere/fire and post are both multi-millisecond in the O01 workloads; the heavy atmosphere/fire stage is 3.130 ms median. Smoke compute is about 0.0205 ms median, approximately 150x smaller than the heavy atmosphere/fire stage.",
