    "solver_decision": "Do not pursue active-region smoke solver work on current evidence. Prioritize shading-path operation attribution; the absorption cache lowers atmosphere/fire stage medians by about 0.058\u20130.101 ms but raises whole GPU-render medians by 0.025\u20130.044 ms across the tested sizes.",
    "what_proxies_show": "Tile membership counters plus independent tile-list toggles show that candidate evaluation is a material part of several stages; projected detail modestly reduces atmosphere/fire work; opaque-light reuse primarily improves optical resolve and leaves atmosphere/fire nearly unchanged."
